	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nihil proxime per <persName>Mathaeum Peyer</persName> respondi, quo<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>niam, antequam scire possem, quid de eo constitueretur, mihi ab <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>urbe discedendum fuit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Reversus nudius tertius inveni <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>iuvenem hunc vestratem, qui cum <persName>Mathaeo</persName> venerat, adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>commeantem hic, per quem paucula haec ad tuas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de">Princi<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>pio, so vil das püntschweeren blanget, kan ich noch anders <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nitt mercken, dann das min herren sich in kein ungöttliche form <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>weder zgen noch znen werdind begäben.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de">Man weißt <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>wol, in wän wir glaubend; bi dem wend wir schweeren; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dann glauben und schweeren ghörend zemmen.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Hoff auch nitt, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>das man den trutz zulaße, das in unser kilchen jeman zuglaßen <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>werde, die helgen anzhencken.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Von <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> schript <persName ref="p3099">Sultzerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>das si aber ein bsonders habind; ghept sich sin übel.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Das wirt <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>uns aber all trännen.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Der abscheid ist noch nitt verläsen <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>und nüt bschloßen; hoff aber durch die gnad gotts nüt <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dann guͦts.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Es gat ein gmümmel, <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> well wol nitt <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>bin h[elgen] schweeren, aber den anderen bin helgen den eid gen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Das glaub ich nitt, dann eins ist als guͦt als das ander, darbi gen <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>und nen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Lieber, brichtend mich darumb; dann üwerer <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>schriben keins diß ußtruckt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName> fervent omnia adhuc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Qui illinc sunt proscripti per nostros <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>redire cuperent.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Varia sunt iudicia de his.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName> pessime <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>audit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Defendimus illum quantum possumus.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Sed tam obtinuit <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>malus de illo rumor ut per nos tolli nequeat.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Aiunt illum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>interesse torturis et quaestionibus coniuratorum, et plane in <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>hac tota causa nihil fieri nisi eius autoritate.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quod ut ego <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>vix credo, ita sunt qui sancte verum esse affirment.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3429">Viretus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> profectus est et ibi concionatus pessimam inivit apud <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nostrates gratiam.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1049">Farellus</persName> quoque illuc profectus impetuositate s<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ua tantum non subvertit omnia, si vera sunt quae publicus <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>fert rumor.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Video enim reipublicae <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevensis</placeName> statum vix hac ratione consistere posse nisi dominus mirabiliter <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>opituletur.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName> certe apud illos quoque male audit, qui <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>hactenus semper illi fautores exsistere.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Parcius illi scribo nunc <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>propter iniquas quibus omnes gravamur suspiciones, deinde quod <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>parum fideliter et caute illos literis nostris uti video.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Ex <placeName ref="l28">Basilea</placeName> quoque vereor, ne emergat monstri aliquid.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Scis <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quid <persName>Bellius</persName> scripserit, sive is qui se hoc nomine occultat, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>quid item responderit <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Agitatur etiam ipsa nunc quaestio inter <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>ministros: an haeretici occidi debeant?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Variae sunt opiniones <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>quibus quidem <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> satisfecit.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Nimiam tamen reprehendunt acri<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>moniam.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Atque ita nunquam caremus contentionibus, quin semper <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>alia ex alia texatur.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Unum nobis hoc est solatium, quod per singularem <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>gratiam dominus nobis dedit in his controversiis idem sentire.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Utinam vero hoc sit <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>stabile et perpetuum.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Et pro hoc tu quoque orabis dominum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/>D. <persName ref="p8012">Quaestor Hallerus</persName> heri reversus est aliquantulum melius habens <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>quam antea; is te salutat.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> nihil habemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>furit, ut scis, Antichristus.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Remitto confessionem <placeName ref="l2472">Polonicam</placeName>; <lb xml:id="p1z51"/>vidimus illam aliquot diebus antea, nihilominus tibi magnas agimus g<lb xml:id="p1z52"/>ratias.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Quod <persName>Mathaeum Bavarum</persName> attinet, retulit sine dubio <lb xml:id="p1z53"/>ipse tibi, quid impetraverit.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">Aegre ferunt nostri, quod videamini <lb xml:id="p1z54"/>subinde aliquos huc transmittere, cum ipsi magnam habeamus expec<lb xml:id="p1z55"/>tantium copiam; certe non parva mihi hinc nascitur molestia, <lb xml:id="p1z56"/>qua libenter vellem carere.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Nostri te omnes salutant.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z57"/>6. augusti 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">H[allerus]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praeter <placeName ref="l2472">Polonicam</placeName> confessionem nihil abs te accepi.</s>
					<s n="46" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Scribis te mittere aliquid, quod sit aeditum a d. d. <persName ref="p1271">Achille <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Gassaro</persName>; sed quicquid id est, nec in <persName ref="p8417">Musculi</persName> nec <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>in meis fuit literis, neque etiam requisitus <persName>Mathaeus Bavarus</persName>, per quem te mittere scribis, se tale quid ha<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>bere aut accepisse fatetur; vide ergo, si forte retinueris tecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="47" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, domino ac compatri suo honorando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="48" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
